  "scope": "A34 pre-PD Q16.16 regression (2026-10-15).\n\nRun inside ~/openlane_project/a34-rtl-fix-pd using the project nix-shell:\n    python3 /path/to/a34_q16_regression.py\n\nPinned candidate: submitted e632192 baseline + exactly four RTL files from\nffe21c28367d943b4d3984dd707e34d0add2551d + converter added to LibreLane YAML.\nThis script reads RTL/configuration and writes only a NEW verification_results\ndirectory. It does not edit RTL, config, GDS, netlists, or Git; does not run PD;\ndoes not fetch dependencies; and does not push anything.\n\nScope: exhaustive standalone converter check over all 65,536 FP16 encodings;\n20 exact-result matrix transactions, including reset recovery; and 2 fractional\nmatrix transactions checked bit-for-bit against a model of the implemented\napproximate arithmetic. Approximation quality is reported separately from\nfunctional agreement. Reset is used before EVERY matrix. Handshake/capture use\ninternal signals: this is not validation of an external host timing protocol.\n\nNot full functional signoff. Accumulation overflow, approximate multiplier\nexponent extremes, physical timing, DRC/LVS, and silicon operation are not\ncertified. The converter saturates at Q16.16 limits; the accumulator wraps on\noverflow. Continuing internal transfers after the output window are observed.\n",
